{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conduct a high-stakes espionage operation at the peak of the Cold War. Intercept and decipher encrypted communications to uncover a hidden threat. Break codes, manipulate targets through social engineering, connect the dots, and escape before it\u2019s too late.<strong> <br><br>From Basement with Love</strong> is a 2D adventure game that combines elements of logical puzzles, detective investigation and visual novel.    <br> <br>As an undercover spy during the Cold War era, you are assigned a dangerous mission to unravel secret military operations that threaten the global security. <br> <br> <br>A small basement room serves both as your living space and as the center of your undercover operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/Main_Room_GIF.gif?t=1749296403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Your desk is equipped with the equipment that allows you to intercept and decipher encrypted communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/Main_Table_GIF.gif?t=1749296403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stay on guard to track and intercept the transmitted messages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/Signal_Adjusting_GIF.gif?t=1749296403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a suitable device to decipher encrypted communication and discover the incoming threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/Cables_GIF.gif?t=1749296403\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manipulate with the targeted person through social engineering to extract further information and unravel the whole truth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/extras/VN_GIF.gif?t=1749296403\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3339280?t=1749296403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749296403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/456c2e99162e7b076478e6ca1b71da1ba941b0f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749296403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339280/456c2e99162e7b076478e6ca1b71da1ba941b0f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749296403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conduct a high-stakes espionage operation at the peak of the Cold War. Intercept and decipher encrypted communications to uncover a hidden threat. Break codes, manipulate targets through social engineering, connect the dots, and escape before it\u2019s too late.<strong> <br><br>From Basement with Love</strong> is a 2D adventure game that combines elements of logical puzzles, detective investigation and visual novel.    <br> <br>As an undercover spy during the Cold War era, you are assigned a dangerous mission to unravel secret military operations that threaten the global security. <br> <br> <br>A small basement room serves both as your living space and as the center of your undercover operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/33392